    "text": "Her saga\u00f0 on \u00feissum bocum \u00fe\u00e6t domne Wynfri\u00f0 sende \u00feis gewrit \u00e6rost to \u00feissum leodum, bi sumum\nHe s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t he bicome to \u00feisse \u00feeode, and \u00fe\u00e6t he sp\u00e6ce wi\u00f0 \u00f0one preost, and he me \u00fea rehte \u00fea\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t him geeode \u00feurh nedbade \u00fe\u00e6t his lichama w\u00e6re seoc geworden, and he w\u00e6s semninga \u00fey\nAnd him \u00feuhte \u00fe\u00e6t hit w\u00e6re on \u00fe\u00e6re onlicnysse \u00fee him man \u00fea eagan weccende mid \u00feicce hr\u00e6gle\nAnd \u00fea \u00e6t nyxtan w\u00e6s eall seo swearte bewrigennis aworpen fram his eagum, \u00fea \u00feuhte him \u00fe\u00e6t eall\nAnd him \u00feuhte \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea englas w\u00e6ron swilce hig byrnende w\u00e6ron, \u00fea \u00fee hine l\u00e6ddon ut of \u00feam\nAnd he s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t hig hine abrudon up in \u00feone lyft, and he \u00fea geseah fyr beornan ymb ealles \u00feyses\nAnd ic w\u00e6s swi\u00f0e unar\u00e6fnedlice ge\u00fer\u00e6sted on minum eagum for \u00feisses micclan brynes ege, and me\nAnd he s\u00e6de, on \u00fe\u00e6re tide \u00fee he w\u00e6s of his lichaman, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feyder w\u00e6re gesamnode of lichamum swa\nAnd he s\u00e6de eac \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6re micel meniu \u00e6t awergedra gasta, and eac \u00feam beorhtum englum \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r\nAnd se man s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t he sylf gehyrde ealle his godwyrcnisse and his agene synna, \u00fea \u00fee he of his\nSum cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic eom idel gilp \u00fee \u00feu mid mannum gylplice ahofe.\nSum cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic eom leasung in \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feu gefirenadest \u00fe\u00e6r \u00feu w\u00e6re ligende.\nSum cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic eom unnyt word \u00fee \u00feu idelice gespr\u00e6ce.\nSum cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic eom gesih\u00f0 \u00feurh \u00fea \u00feu gefirenadest.\nSum cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic eom gemanes and ungehersumnes, \u00fe\u00e6r \u00feu ealdum gastlicum mannum ungehyrsum\nSum cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic eom drupung and sleacnis \u00fee \u00feu w\u00e6re receleas in haligra gewrita geornesse.\nSum cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic eom swiciende ge\u00feoht and unnyt gamen, \u00fee \u00feu o\u00f0ra manna lif eahtodest and \u00fein agen lif\nSum cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic eom slapolnis mid \u00feam \u00feu w\u00e6re ge\u00fericced, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu late arise Gode to andettenne.\nSum cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic eom unnytnys, and hig him on s\u00e6don manega \u00feing \u00feissum gelic.\nAnd ealle \u00fea \u00fee he on his lifes dagum lifigende gefremode, \u00fee he areceleasode to andettenne, and\nAnd he \u00fe\u00e6r geseah eac sumne \u00feara manna \u00fee he \u00e6r gewundode \u00fea hwile \u00fee he lifigende w\u00e6s, and se\n\u00dea ladedon me min \u00fe\u00e6t lyttla m\u00e6gen \u00fea \u00fee ic earma and unmeodumlice gedyde.\nSum cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic eom f\u00e6sten \u00fee he his lichaman on acl\u00e6nsode wi\u00f0 \u00f0am yfelan geornissum.\nSum cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic eom hluttor gebed \u00fe\u00e6t he geat in Drihtnes gesih\u00f0e.\nSum cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic eom untrumra \u00feegnung, \u00fea he mildelice siocum gedyde.\nSum cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic eom sealmsang \u00feone he Gode gedyde to bote his unnyttra worda, and swa him cegde\nAnd he s\u00e6de eac \u00fe\u00e6t he geseage on \u00feissum nio\u00f0eran middanearde fyrene sea\u00f0as, and \u00fea w\u00e6ron swi\u00f0e\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 him an to of \u00feam halgan englum, \u00feeos lyttle rest getacna\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lmihtig Drihten syle\u00f0\nAnd se man gehyrde under \u00feam sea\u00f0um, in \u00fe\u00e6re nio\u00f0eran helle, swi\u00f0e egeslic granung and swi\u00f0e\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 him to an \u00fe\u00e6ra engla, \u00feeos granung and \u00fees wop \u00fee \u00feu her gehyrest in \u00feisse nio\u00f0eran helle,\nAnd he \u00fe\u00e6r geseah eac on sume stowe swi\u00f0e wundorlicre f\u00e6gernisse, and \u00fe\u00e6r blissode swi\u00f0e f\u00e6gera\n\u00dea com \u00feanon swi\u00f0e micel sweg, and se w\u00e6s on swi\u00f0e micelre swetnysse, \u00feis \u00feonne w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6ra\n\u00deeos stow \u00feonne w\u00e6s be \u00fean \u00fee englas him s\u00e6dan \u00fe\u00e6t hit w\u00e6s se m\u00e6ra niorxnawang.\nAnd he \u00fe\u00e6r geseah fyren ea, sio w\u00e6s gefylled mid weallende wite, and hio w\u00e6s eall inneweard\n\u00deonne efstan \u00fea halgan sawla to \u00fe\u00e6re bricge fram \u00feam gemote \u00fee hig \u00e6t w\u00e6ron, and hig gyrndon \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00deonne ferdon hig sume swi\u00f0e anr\u00e6dlice ofer \u00fea bricge.\nAnd sume hig wurdon aslidene of \u00feam triowe, \u00fe\u00e6t hig befeollan in \u00fea tintregan ea, sume hig befiollan\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 an engel to him bi \u00feam feallendum sawlum, \u00feis syndon \u00fea sawla \u00fee \u00e6fter hinsi\u00f0e sumere\nAnd he s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fe\u00e6r gesege scinende weallas, \u00fea w\u00e6ron on micelre biorhtnesse and on\n\u00dea cw\u00e6don \u00fea halgan englas, \u00feis is sio halige and sio m\u00e6rlice ceaster Hierusalem, in \u00fe\u00e6re gef\u00e6gnia\u00f0\nAnd \u00feonne \u00fea sawla coman ofer \u00fea ea, \u00fee ic \u00e6r big s\u00e6de, \u00feonne efstan hig eallum m\u00e6gne wi\u00f0 \u00f0issa\nHe \u00feonne s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t hig w\u00e6ron swi\u00f0e beorhte scinende, and he s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t him wurde for \u00feisse micclan\nS\u00e6de eac \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r cumen w\u00e6re sumes mannes sawul to \u00feam gemote se wear\u00f0 dead in abboddomes\n\u00dea gegripon \u00fea deoflu \u00fea sawle, and hig s\u00e6don \u00fe\u00e6t hio w\u00e6re hiora hlytes and hiora anwealdes.\n\u00dea andswarode him an of \u00feam halgan englum and cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic eow nu gecy\u00f0e hra\u00f0e, ge earman gastas,\n\u00dea mid \u00fey \u00fee \u00feis gecweden w\u00e6s, \u00fea com \u00fe\u00e6r f\u00e6rlice micel heap swi\u00f0e hwittra sawla, and \u00feus w\u00e6ron\n\u00dea gefuhton \u00fea englas wi\u00f0 \u00f0am deoflum, and \u00fea englas \u00fea geeoden on \u00fea deoflu \u00fe\u00e6t hig generedon \u00fea\n\u00dea \u00fereade se halga engel \u00fea deoflu, and cw\u00e6\u00f0, Wite ge nu \u00fe\u00e6t ge genamon \u00feas sawle buton rihte,\nAnd \u00fea se engel \u00feis gecweden h\u00e6fde, \u00fea ahofan \u00fea awyrigdan deoflu swi\u00f0e orm\u00e6tlicne hiaf, and hig\nAnd hig fliton eac bi \u00feara manna gewyrhtum \u00fee in \u00feissum life mislice lifia\u00f0.\nAnd he s\u00e6de eac, on \u00fea tid \u00fee he w\u00e6s buton lichaman, \u00fe\u00e6t he mihte sceawian \u00fea men \u00fea \u00fee w\u00e6ron\nAnd he geseah \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea Godes men w\u00e6ron symble biscyldende fram \u00feam englum, and \u00fea englas w\u00e6ron\nAnd he s\u00e6de bi \u00feam mannum \u00fee w\u00e6ron gefylde mid manfullum synnum, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6ron symble\nAnd he s\u00e6de \u00feonne se man firnode \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea deoflu brohtan \u00e6lce synne onsundran \u00feam o\u00f0rum deoflum\nAnd he s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t he geseage grindan her on worulde an m\u00e6gden on anre cweorne.\n\u00dea gesioh hio licgan o\u00feres m\u00e6gdnes lorh wi\u00f0 hig, swi\u00f0e f\u00e6gre awrittenne, mid fagum flese.\n\u00dea forst\u00e6l hio hine.\n\u00dea w\u00e6ron \u00fea deoflu sona gefylled mid swi\u00f0e orm\u00e6tlice gefean, and \u00fe\u00e6r urnon sona fif \u00fea wyrrestan\nAnd s\u00e6de eac \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fe\u00e6r gesege sumes ealdes preostes sawle on micelre unrotnesse se w\u00e6s lyttle \u00e6r\n\u00dea ahead he hit him, ac his lices bro\u00f0or for his gitsunge ag\u00e6lde \u00fea bene and nolde hig gefyllen.\n\u00dea w\u00e6s his sawul on \u00fe\u00e6re hextan sworetunge, and w\u00e6s wregende hire \u00feone ungetriowan bro\u00f0er, and\nAnd \u00fea \u00feis w\u00e6s eall \u00feuss gespecen and gesceawod, \u00fea bibudon \u00fea eadigan englas \u00fe\u00e6t his sawul\nAnd sumum wife he gerehte hire synne, sio w\u00e6s eardigende in feor\u00feiode, and he hire gecydde \u00fe\u00e6t hio\nAnd sumum m\u00e6ssepreoste he gerehte ealle \u00feas gastlican gesih\u00f0e.\n\u00de\u00e6s m\u00e6ssepreostes nama w\u00e6s Bogia, and se hine gel\u00e6rde \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fea gesih\u00f0e mannum cydde.\nAnd he gecydde \u00feam preoste \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6s iu for manegum wintrum bigyrded for Godes lufan mid\nAnd he s\u00e6de \u00fea he eft sceolde to his lichaman, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fea n\u00e6nigre o\u00f0ru wiht swa swi\u00f0e onscunode on\nAnd him \u00fea w\u00e6s biboden \u00fe\u00e6t he hwyrfde to his lichaman in d\u00e6gred, and \u00e6r he eode of his lichaman",
